# Source data and originals not needed in the deployment
# (patterns are root-anchored so src/data is NOT excluded)
/www/
/data/
/scripts/
/.github/
*.R
*.Rproj
/.Renviron.example
/nflmodel/
# NOTE: deliberately NOT excluding /fantasy-football/ here. That
# directory is a second Vercel project whose Root Directory points at
# it, and a root-level ignore risks excluding the very folder that
# project builds from. Excluding it saved a few hundred KB of upload
# on the archives project and was not worth that failure mode -- the
# archives build never compiles it anyway (Next only builds src/app,
# and tsconfig.json excludes it from typechecking).
